---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Apps"
  description="Thought Trail and the Dhamma app — two apps built in conversation with AI."
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Apps</p>
    <h1>Built in conversation with AI.</h1>
    <p class="measure page-head__dek">
      Both apps live on Lovable for now. Each link opens the app in its own tab —
      nothing here is rebuilt or embedded, just pointed to.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="thought-trail" class="wrap app-section">
    <div class="app-section__meta">
      <p class="eyebrow">Live</p>
      <h2>Thought Trail</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="app-section__body measure">
     <p>
        We're living through the fastest-changing time yet — exciting, but
        disorienting too.
      </p>
      <p>
        Thoughts to process. Decisions to make. Changes to adapt to. What do
        they mean? Where do you start? How do you plan for what's next?
      </p>
      <p>Follow a path to find out:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Navigate</strong> — for when you want clarity in the middle
          of disorientation.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Explore</strong> — for when you're weighing open options.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Logic Models</strong> — one step further, for when you want
          to understand your own decision-making.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a class="cta" href="https://aiscout.naratends.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Open Thought Trail ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="dhamma" class="wrap app-section">
    <div class="app-section__meta">
      <p class="eyebrow">In development</p>
  <h2>Dhamma — Path to Clarity</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="app-section__body measure">
      <p>
        This app is under construction. We're designing the right approach —
        one that can meet practical questions with the accuracy Dhamma
        deserves.
      </p>
      <p>Until then, may we all practice a little more clarity of mind.</p>
      <p class="app-section__status">Not yet open to users.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head { padding: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-4); }
  .page-head__dek { margin-top: var(--space-2); color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .app-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-4) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .app-section__meta h2 { margin-top: 0.2em; }
  .app-section__body ul { padding-left: 1.2em; }
  .app-section__body li { margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.6em 1.1em;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .cta:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
  .app-section__status {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .app-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
